        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana DSH4SR532D, 4\" x 4\"x 5/8\" Radius x Square Corner Leaf Single Action Stainless Steel Spring Hinge </b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nDirect fit replacement for THERMA-TRU doors. Packaged complete with One Single Action Spring Door Hinge, Allen Wrench, Adjusting Pin, Locking Pin plus #10 x 1\" Wood Screws and #10-24 x 1/2\" Machine Screws. Utilizes THERMA-TRU door zig-zag screw hole pattern.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe included Allen Wrench Tool is use to adjust spring tension. The Locking Pin holds the spring in tension after it is set. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThese adjustable tension spring hinges allow you to determine how much closing force you apply to the door (how hard/fast the door self closes). \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-DSH4SR5U-specifications.gif?v=1704354779\" width=\"571\" height=\"269\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Deltana DSH4SR5 Hinge Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Stainless Steel  4\" THERMA-TRU Spring Hinge:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Hinge Material: Stainless Steel </li>\r\n<li>Hinge Finish: <b>Brushed Stainless</b></li>\r\n<li>Height: 4\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 4\"</li>\r\n<li>Corner: 5/8\" Radius Leaf</li>\r\n<li>Corner: Square Corner Leaf</li>\r\n<li>Thickness: 0.097\" (Residential)</li>\r\n<li>THERMA-TRU Door Zig-Zag Hole Pattern</li>\r\n<li>Handed</li>\r\n<li>Wood Screws: #10 x 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Machine Screws: #10-24 x 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-DSH4SR5U-specifications.pdf?v=1704262340\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana DSH4SR5 Hinge Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis same hinge is also available <a href=\"/products/4-x-4-x-5-8-radius-x-square-corner-leaf-single-action-spring-hinge-deltana-dsh4sr5\">made from Durable Steel in more finish colors</a>.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Sold Individually.</b>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Important</b> When selecting <b>Door Hand</b> for this door closer:  \r\n<br>\r\n1. Stand on the <b>Push Side</b> of the door, facing the door. <br>\r\n2. If the \"Pivot Hinge\" is on your \"Left\", choose \"Left Hand Door\". <br>\r\n3. If the \"Pivot Hinge\" is on your \"Right\", choose \"Right Hand Door\". <br>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/closer-handing.gif?v=1704354510\"  width=\"410\" height=\"195\" border=\"0\"alt=\"door handing\">\r\n</p>",
